       "text": "Halvern Dam at Brindlemark in the Assek Valley was reported damaged on September 9, 2025.",
       "confidence": "confirmed",
       "tweet_ids": []
      },
      {
       "id": "1a.2",
       "text": "Damage extended to the right abutment of the dam, and the alert level was raised from Yellow to Orange within a day.",
       "confidence": "confirmed",
       "tweet_ids": []
      },
      {
       "id": "1a.3",
       "text": "Roughly 11,800 residents were evacuated from Brindlemark, with further residents evacuated from Ferris Hollow.",
       "confidence": "confirmed",
       "tweet_ids": []
      },
      {
       "id": "1a.4",
       "text": "The Sorrel Basin Water Authority and the dam operator issued public information while the mandatory evacuation remained in force.",
       "confidence": "confirmed",
       "tweet_ids": []
      }
     ]
    }
